// A pine plugs the only gap in the wall. Once a tick's crowd load exceeds its
// root it falls south onto the second pine, whose root its momentum breaks:
// that one falls through where you start. Step aside, or stay and be struck.
// The two small bare trees yield to a Slam. Logs and stumps stay solid, so
// the gap stays closed. No rule counts enemies or exempts the player.
(
    scene: (
        engine: (
            name: "Crowd pressure — felled grove",
            walls: [
                (centre: (-2.225, 7.0), size: (3.95, 0.4), yaw: 0.0),
